      "en": "Again he says, “Rejoice, you Gentiles, with his people.”",
      "ko": "또 가로되 열방들아 주의 백성과 함께 즐거워하라 하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "3d2014943490e48dc30c55ab2ecfffee15d5e474cb5c0276f8e6daefa471b0de",
      "translation_text_hash": "e5dd9020f39b1588a55f8e9729f3b27c72641ad5190144fd9f3be8bafab16dc4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
