        "verse": 14
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ROM",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "I myself am also persuaded about you, my brothers, that you yourselves are full of goodness, filled with all knowledge, able also to admonish others.",
      "ko": "내 형제들아 너희가 스스로 선함이 가득하고 모든 지식이 차서 능히 서로 권하는 자임을 나도 확신하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "6fcab0936337deac6c852f61b01bc5ca9f3c49dcc93ee55f22d4bbe4ab007992",
      "translation_text_hash": "dbcedbce1314650f8d6b152c35447b7a7be87d0f673b9d35212bf77234ecf935",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
