      "en": "Yes, it has been their good pleasure, and they are their debtors. For if the Gentiles have been made partakers of their spiritual things, they owe it to them also to serve them in material things.",
      "ko": "저희가 기뻐서 하였거니와 또한 저희는 그들에게 빚진 자니 만일 이방인들이 그들의 신령한 것을 나눠 가졌으면 육신의 것으로 그들을 섬기는 것이 마땅하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "f93bc80b4bce5dcbfc875ac9ea14cb0089ca17eb09938979210dd58aa3e2da48",
      "translation_text_hash": "6e00c23c521411ce825cfe9abfa1c5ce755df84abac5144b596081b8e35ed333",
